      "statement": "Several unique indexes on soft-deletable models are partial indexes scoped with postgresql_where=text(\"is_active\") (e.g. uq_course_title_active, uq_module_course_title_active, uq_system_setting_key), allowing a code/title to be reused once the prior active row is deactivated.",
